WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.600
The power of ten says how far the decimal point moves, and which way.

2
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:08.125
With power zero the point stays where it is.

3
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:17.025
Power three: the point moves three places right.

4
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.550
Power minus three: the point moves three places left.
